# Feedback Management Admin Panel

A simple MERN Stack admin panel for managing course feedback records. This project includes a Node.js + Express backend, MongoDB Atlas integration, and a React + Vite frontend dashboard for viewing, adding, updating, and deleting feedback.

## Features
- Admin dashboard with course feedback table
- Add new feedback form
- Update existing feedback records
- Delete records with confirmation
- Responsive UI for desktop, tablet, and mobile
- MongoDB Atlas connectivity using Mongoose
- API validation for required fields and rating range

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: React, Vite, React Router
- Backend: Node.js, Express.js, Mongoose
- Database: MongoDB Atlas

